        {
          "question": "q-15664",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14035554/assets/e4b9bd92b63d85b0336974285b6aa7a8a7beb8348cf368f65d805f7b4b70ffa2.png)\n\nGiven the plots of $y=f(x)$ and $y=g(x)$ above, find ${h}^{\u2032}(1)$ where $h(x)=\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}.$",
